\subsection{Audio Capture}
Audio-sensitive devices must be configured to prioritize privacy.
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Cameras should record audio but not broadcasting video.
    \item Disable microphones or mute the audio input on the recording device.
    \item Use encrypted storage to prevent unauthorized access to audio files.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection{Legal and Ethical Considerations}
Ensure all data handling complies with local laws and privacy regulations.
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Verify warrant requirements before installation.
    \item Confirm that camera feeds are stored locally or encrypted to prevent unauthorized viewing.
    \item Respect the confidentiality of the investigation and avoid public release of footage unless legally mandated.
\end{enumerate}

